{
  "schema_version": 5,
  "kind": "weak_scaling",
  "defaults": "benchmark_problem.json",
  "description": "Experiment 5 rerun in one job: the references and 1, 4, 9, 16, 36, 64, 144 and 256 ranks (square process grids 1x1 ... 16x16), same setup as weak_scaling.json (256 x 256 cells per rank, dx = dy = 1/256, basin grows). hpc/jobs/exp5_rerun.pbs runs them on 4 nodes, so all points share one commit, one build and the column poisson_sum_min_s.",
